tip: | Look at the apple. | Almost every pixel of the fruit is one of four steps on the Brick ramp. No black and no white went in.
tip: 3 | Base, shadow, highlight. | Base first. The shadow is one step down, on the side away from the light. The light side is one step up.
tip: | Try it. | Pick the Lighten / Darken tool and stroke along the bottom of the apple. Each pixel moves one step along its ramp, so the shading stays clean. | shade
